# kakaoMap design skills

Before changing UI (layout, color, type, components, motion), read in this order:

1. [PRODUCT.md](PRODUCT.md) — product truth, constraints, brand assets
2. [DESIGN.md](DESIGN.md) — visual tokens (normative)
3. [design-system/MASTER.md](design-system/MASTER.md) — filtered ui-ux-pro-max rules
4. [design-system/pages/map.md](design-system/pages/map.md) if touching map chrome

## Skill roles

- **impeccable** — Operate mode. Preserve search, filters, clustering, sheet gestures. Refine chrome; do not replace the map world.
- **ui-ux-pro-max** — Use the filtered MASTER, not the raw orange persist in `design-system/kakaomap/MASTER.md`.
- **taste-skill** — Anti-slop only (no purple gradients, Inter-default, glass-everything, marketing card grids, GSAP heroes). This is product map UI, not a landing page.

## Invariants

- Static HTML/CSS/JS. Do not add a framework for styling.
- Keep brand filter icons in `icons/`.
- Map stays full viewport. Chrome floats on top.
- Marker/cluster fade is the only motion system.
- Compact chrome is `max-width: 767px`. Desktop keeps the full labeled tool stack.
- Location is a bottom-right FAB, never inside the search row.
- Compact layers menu opens below the toggle, not to the left.
- Compact search input stays 16px. Leave 8px between search and zoom.
